-      // 200 ~ 1000Hz, which is A3(57) ~ C6(84). In this test, the starting
-      // pitch is 220Hz and the interval is the whole tone. (2 MIDI pitch)
-      // With 16 speakers, the last test tone will play the MIDI pitch of
